    "summary": {
      "value": "Bind a previously unknown Arcanum, and improve dismiss effects."
    },
    "description": "<p><strong>Requirements:</strong> you must have mastered <strong>Arcanist</strong>.</p><hr><p>You make contact with an unknown Arcanum and bind it to your soul. This Arcanum must be something you design together with the rest of the group; as long as you live, no one else in your world will be able to bind that Arcanum.</p><p>Once per scene while you are <strong>merged</strong> with an Arcanum, you may use an action and spend 2 Fabula Points to <strong>trigger</strong> that Arcanum's <strong>dismiss</strong> effect (if any) without dismissing them. Doing so <strong>does not</strong> trigger the <strong>Arcane Circle</strong> Skill.</p>",
